msgid "Allow all profiles to generate the permissions matrix?"
msgstr "Vai atļaut visiem profiliem ģenerēt atļauju matricu?"

msgid "Notice:"
msgstr "Paziņojums:"

msgid ""
"To grant or remove access for a specific profile to the permissions matrix, "
"go to the desired profile and adjust this setting in the 'Permissions "
"Matrix' tab."
msgstr ""
"Lai piešķirtu vai noņemtu piekļuvi konkrētam profilam atļauju matricai, "
"dodieties uz vajadzīgo profilu un pielāgojiet šo iestatījumu cilnē Atļauju "
"matrica."

msgid "Security Recommendation:"
msgstr "Drošības ieteikums:"

msgid ""
"It is strongly recommended to restrict this permission to Super-Admin "
"profiles only. Allowing this option for all enables regular users to view "
"sensitive assignment and group data across the entire system."
msgstr ""
"Ir ļoti ieteicams ierobežot šo atļauju tikai Super-Admin profiliem. Atļaujot"
" šo opciju visiem, regulāri lietotāji var skatīt sensitīvus uzdevumus un "
"grupēt datus visā sistēmā."

msgid "Saving..."
msgstr "Notiek saglabāšana..."

msgid "Permissions granted to all profiles."
msgstr "Atļaujas piešķirtas visiem profiliem."

msgid "Permissions removed from all profiles (except Super-Admin)."
msgstr "Atļaujas noņemtas no visiem profiliem (izņemot Super-Admin)."
